==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Porygon|103}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion; both cards have the Beam attack.
*'''Beam''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Porygon|103}} and {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Porygon2|104}}, both from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

